OL,3,GNEWSAConsortium working to try saving
OL,4,Afootball club
OL,5,
OL,6,FA beleaguered football club said a
OL,7,Fbusiness consortium was putting
OL,8,Ftogether a plan to save it from the
OL,9,Fprospect of collapse.
OL,11,FLast week, fans of Maldon and Tiptree
OL,12,FFC in Essex said the club's
OL,13,Frepresentatives had told them they
OL,14,Fintended to wind up its affairs.
OL,16,FBarrie Drewitt-Barlow and husband Scott
OL,17,FDrewitt-Barlow, who bought the club in
OL,18,F2025, are in custody awaiting trial
OL,19,Faccused of multiple offences including
OL,20,Frape and sexual assault.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
